      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that even if things \"get better,\" the effort to get there feels impossible. like i'm just stuck in this loop of trying to fix myself so i can keep going, but the fixing is what's killing me. it feels like i've done everything i can and i'm still just... empty. it's like there's no real way to actually find peace, just more maintenance.",
